{#
  « Mouvements du compte » — the second card of « Finances » (chantier
  #927, §2.4): the bank movements reconciled with the booking's
  receivable, oldest first — the renter's payments and the refunds of
  their surplus.

  Read through Finance's Api (ExpectedReceivableInterface::
  getReceivableMovements()), so each line is THIS booking's share of a
  movement and nothing else of the account is ever shown: not the rest
  of a transfer shared with another receivable, not the movements that
  belong to nobody yet.

  A payment's share is capped at what the receivable expects, so once it
  was brought down — a validated settlement, an abandoned booking — part
  of what came in is nobody's share: it is the surplus, shown as its own
  line so the column still adds up to what the renter paid.

  A movement a person reconciled says who and when (« Rapproché à la
  main par …, le … »), and one attached from « Rapprocher un virement »
  offers « Détacher » for as long as no settlement validated since has
  counted it (#980, chantier §2.6, Q11): the controller says which
  (`detachable_transactions`), the service checks it again on the POST.
  « Rapprocher un virement » opens the dialog of
  `_finance_transfer.html.twig`.

  Requires `movements` (list<Finance\Api\ReceivableMovement>), `payment`,
  `asset`, `booking`, `booking_page` and the keys of
  RentalManagementController::transferContext(): `transfer_available`,
  `movement_authors` and `detachable_transactions`.
#}
{% set absorbed = movements|filter(m => m.amountCents > 0)|reduce((sum, m) => sum + m.amountCents, 0) %}
{% set beyond = payment.received_cents|default(0) - absorbed %}
<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Mouvements du compte</h2>
        <div data-booking-panel="payment-movements">
            {% if movements is empty and beyond <= 0 %}
                <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-2" data-finance-movements-empty>
                    Aucun mouvement rapproché pour cette réservation.
                </p>
            {% else %}
                <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table class="table table-sm align-middle mb-2" data-finance-movements>
                        <caption class="visually-hidden">Mouvements du compte rapprochés de cette réservation</caption>
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th scope="col">Date</th>
                                <th scope="col">Libellé</th>
                                <th scope="col" class="text-end">Montant</th>
                                <th scope="col">Imputation</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            {% for movement in movements %}
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="text-nowrap">{{ movement.date|date_fr }}</td>
                                    <td class="text-break">
                                        {% if movement.counterpartyName %}{{ movement.counterpartyName }} — {% endif %}{{ movement.label }}
                                        {% if movement.isRefund %}
                                            <span class="small text-body-secondary d-block">Remboursement</span>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="text-end text-nowrap">
                                        {{ movement.amountCents > 0 ? '+' : '' }}{{ movement.amountCents|money_cents }}
                                    </td>
                                    <td>
                                        {% include 'partials/status_badge.html.twig' with {
                                            status: movement.automatic ? 'done' : 'info',
                                            label: movement.automatic ? 'Automatique' : 'Manuelle',
                                        } only %}
                                        {% set author = movement_authors[movement.transactionId] ?? null %}
                                        {% if movement.reconciledAt and author %}
                                            <span class="small text-body-secondary d-block" data-movement-reconciled-by>
                                                Rapproché à la main par {{ author }},
                                                le {{ movement.reconciledAt|date_fr }}
                                            </span>
                                        {% endif %}
                                        {% if movement.transactionId in detachable_transactions|default([]) %}
                                            {% include '@rental/management/_finance_movement_detach.html.twig' %}
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                            {% if beyond > 0 %}
                                <tr data-finance-movement-beyond>
                                    <td></td>
                                    <td>Reçu au-delà du montant attendu</td>
                                    <td class="text-end text-nowrap">+{{ beyond|money_cents }}</td>
                                    <td>
                                        {% include 'partials/status_badge.html.twig' with {
                                            status: 'pending', label: 'Trop-perçu',
                                        } only %}
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            {% endif %}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">
                Les virements apparaissent après l'import d'un extrait bancaire. Seuls les mouvements de
                cette réservation sont montrés.
            </p>
            {% if transfer_available|default(false) %}
                <div class="mt-3" data-transfer-open>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary w-100 w-sm-auto"
                            data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#rapprocher-virement">
                        Rapprocher un virement
                    </button>
                    <p class="small text-body-secondary mt-2 mb-0">
                        Pour un paiement arrivé sans la communication de la réservation, par exemple celui de
                        l'assurance du locataire.
                    </p>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
